<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-16T11:50:32.210Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:50:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Russia sent a major business delegation to Kabul for talks with the Taliban, while Iran and Afghanistan expanded agricultural trade to $2.7 billion. In Rajasthan, a Punjab woman was recruited by a Pakistan-based ISI handler through a romantic relationship and participated in a railway-track blast that killed two people, prompting arrests of two suspects linked to Pakistani handlers. Separate incidents include a blast from unexploded ordnance in Ghazni that killed one child and injured another, and two shootings in South Africa that left 17 dead. The conflict recorded 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/russia-sends-major-business-delegation-to-kabul-for-business-talks-with-the-taliban&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Babushahi.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE5tNER2Q0R1bkdBSW8tSE1peEtMdGJ3WU5Yc0FIa014NDVKN1BrdzEwRHVyb002NjJfVUJDb0ZnY2FIbWtIVVRnWUZZbTdMcGwwaGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Financial Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Organiser&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNWlF4amxsREJSNE5FSUhLVXp2MFNPcVNNTm5DeUF1R3RYbWxrc2hTQm9BVnZWZWptN2tpMEhkT0dWYkNINjZBRENqS3hoZTNRQ0M2d1NMeU1ad3pkOTdWc2FrT3hacjMxV0tRSzM2U3NSN29XV29uT00yeks2YUo3SDV2cFBSYVJTV3NV?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pajhwok Afghan News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE9iRGpuZFZqWS1BcTdyRmVjczByaXhzelZQN18wQmN2SWEzazZtWTc4QlZGLUt2d3Z1RFEyVUl6ZDE2NjZwMm9rTDFxYmVtV1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;thekabultribune.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news